==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[CTO Seal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[CTO Seal]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[The Red Malice]] spawns.
**3 [[Christmas D.|Christmas Ds]] spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Similarly to the original [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 11|Floor 11]], all the enemies here are [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] ones. However, most of the enemies here have good range, and two of them effectively permafreeze units that happen to wander into their range. Ranged Attackers and [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] are both very useful for this stage, as are units with [[:Category:Cats with Freeze Immunity|Freeze Immunity]].

